    : 'Show the exact supplied service and one qualified professional actively performing the requested safe repair or maintenance task on recognizable equipment with accurate trade-specific tools and PPE. If Repair is requested, show active troubleshooting, adjustment, repair, or component replacement—not a passive inspection.';
const prompt = [
